  "description": "A CSS flexbox-style layout panel for CodeBrix.Platform apps on every head: Windows (Win32 and Skia-on-WPF), Linux (X11, Wayland, FrameBuffer), and macOS. FlexPanel is a XAML Panel that arranges its children in optionally wrapping rows or columns with the familiar flexbox model: Direction (row/column, both reversible), JustifyContent (including SpaceBetween/SpaceAround/SpaceEvenly), AlignItems/AlignContent, wrapping with WrapReverse, and the per-child attached properties FlexPanel.Grow, FlexPanel.Shrink, FlexPanel.Basis (absolute or percentage), FlexPanel.Order, and FlexPanel.AlignSelf. The layout engine is a managed port of the Microsoft .NET MAUI FlexLayout engine (MIT) - no native dependencies.",
